  "summary_en": "European Commission web page describing the Apply AI Strategy, the EU's sectoral AI adoption strategy. It sets flagships across 10 industries (including robotics) and the public sector, measures for technological sovereignty such as AI Factories and sandboxes, and a new governance system with the Apply AI Alliance and AI Observatory.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Promotes an 'AI first' policy and 'buy European' approach, especially for the public sector, favouring open source.",
   "Sectoral flagships across 10 industries including robotics, plus the public sector.",
   "Strengthens Experience Centres for AI, AI Factories and Gigafactories, testing facilities and regulatory sandboxes.",
   "Creates the Apply AI Alliance as a coordination forum and an AI Observatory to track sector impacts.",
   "Complemented by AI in Science strategy (RAISE), Data Union Strategy and the Cloud and AI Development Act."
